PARSFILE
#FullDataName Models: Simulink`ABS Controller`Braking Controls
#RunMdlFile Extensions\simulink\abs_CS9.mdl
#RingCtrl1 2
OPT_INT_METHOD 2
#CheckBox0 0    
*USE_ALT_DIR 0
#CheckBox1 0    
